EIP712SignatureValidator
├── given a domain and encoded EIP-712 struct
│   ├── when the digest matches it returns the ERC-1271 magic value
│   ├── when the digest differs it returns the invalid value
│   └── when the payload is malformed it reverts and the adapter rejects it
├── given a Merkle adapter
│   ├── it requires authorization of the exact digest and signature payload
│   └── revoking the stored signature invalidates the order
└── given a CoW order permission
    ├── it matches the upstream GPv2Order hash
    ├── it allows amounts, expiry and appData to change under one leaf
    ├── it pins the validator, domain, type hash, pair, receiver, fee, kind and balances
    └── it pins all ABI pointers and lengths and the mask itself
